The dataset in sample/data/public/ is published separately from the code, under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

It consists of factual records about publicly listed apps — names, developers,
dates, prices, categories and rating counts — gathered from public Apple
endpoints and dated at the time of reading.

It deliberately excludes app descriptions and release-note text, which remain
the copyright of their respective developers. Only derived measurements of that
text are published (for example its length, or whether release notes are
present). Regenerate the full records locally with the scripts in sample/ if you
need them.

